'''Gholdengo ex''' (Japanese: '''サーフゴーex''' ''Surfugo ex'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 1 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

