==Trivia==
===Origin===
*All of this card's illustrations were first featured on {{TCG ID|Paradox Rift|Gholdengo ex|139}} from the {{TCG|Paradox Rift}} expansion.
**This card's special illustration rare artwork forms a combined illustration with {{TCG ID|Paldean Wonders|Gimmighoul|96}}, which was also [[Gimmighoul (Paradox Rift 198)|first featured]] in Paradox Rift.

